{"id":"word:hebrew:H713","type":"word","title":"אַרְגָּמָן","subtitle":"H713 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"purple (the color or the dyed stuff)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אַרְגָּמָן (H713) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 38 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אַרְגָּמָן (ʼargâmân) means purple (the color or the dyed stuff) First listed occurrence: 2Chr 2 13."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אַרְגָּמָן","transliteration":"ʼargâmân","pronunciation":"ar-gaw-mawn'","strong":"H713","lemmaId":"hebrew:H713","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["וְ/אַרְגָּמָ֛ן","וְ/אַרְגָּמָן֙","וְ/אַרְגָּמָ֜ן","וְ/אַרְגָּמָ֖ן","הָֽ/אַרְגָּמָ֔ן"],"morphs":[["HC/Ncmsa",26],["HTd/Ncmsa",4],["HNcmsa",3],["HRd/Ncmsa",2],["HC/Rd/Ncmsa",2],["HC/Td/Ncmsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"purple (the color or the dyed stuff)","usage":"purple.","full":"H713. argaman אַרְגָּמָן noun [masculine] purple, red-purple, i.e. purple thread & cloth (Assyrian argamannu COT Exod 25:4 , Arabic , Aramaic , compare אַרְגְּוָן above; etymology dubious; possibly Sanskrit râgaman , adjective red, reddish , from râga , red colour, so Benary compare Thes Add 111 Rob-Ges; see MV; Thes earlier, from רגם ; but probably loan-word, compare also Lag BN 205 ; Persian is also cited by PS) — form always as above — 1 purple thread , compare especially Exod 35:25 ; 39:3 ; Est 1:6 ; a. mostly Exodus (P) with reference to the hangings of tabernacle, the ephod, etc.; seldom alone; with תְּכֵלֶת , violet (q. v.), שָׁנִי תּוֺלַעַת , ( מָשְׁזָב ) שֵׁשׁ , (also עִזִּים ) Exod 25:4 ; 26:1 , 31 , 36 ; 27:16 ; 35:8 , 25 , 35 ; 36:8 , 35 , 37 ; 38:18 , 23 ; 39:24 (on text see Di) 39:29 ; with these + זָהָב 28:5-6 , 8 , 15 ; 39:2 ; 39:3 ; 39:5 ; 39:8 ; omitted מ ׳שֵׁשׁ 28:33 ; 39:1 ; also of temple-hangings, with בּוּץ תְּכֵלֶת, & כַּרְמִיל 2Chr 3:14 ; compare 2:13 (see also 2:6 see below אַרְגְּוָן ). b. as indicating wealth & luxury of Tyre, c . תְּכֵלֶת רִקְמָה, שֵׁשׁ, Ezek 27:7 ; with רִקְמָה & בּוּץ 27:16 (as articles of commerce); also in Persia, with בּוּץ Est 1:6 . 2 purple cloth , chiefly of garments, א ׳בֶּגֶד Num 4:13 ; Judg 8:26 ; וְא בּוּץ ׳וְתַכְרִיךְ Est 8:15 , וְא ׳שֵׁשׁ לְבוּשָׁהּ Prov 31:22 ; וְא ׳תְּכֵלָת לְבוּשָׁם Jer 10:9 ; also א ׳מֶרְכָּבוֺ Cant 3:10; in simile, of woman's hair Cant 7:6.","rootNote":"of foreign origin;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Chr 2 13","keyReferences":["2Chr 2 13","2Chr 3 14","Esth 1 6","Esth 8 15","Exod 25 4","Exod 26 1","Exod 26 31","Exod 26 36"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":38,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Chr 2 13","book":"2Chr","chapter":2,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בָּ/אַרְגָּמָ֤ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 3 14","book":"2Chr","chapter":3,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אַרְגָּמָ֖ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Esth 1 6","book":"Esth","chapter":1,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אַרְגָּמָ֔ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Esth 8 15","book":"Esth","chapter":8,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אַרְגָּמָ֑ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 25 4","book":"Exod","chapter":25,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אַרְגָּמָ֛ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 26 1","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אַרְגָּמָן֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 26 31","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אַרְגָּמָ֛ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 26 36","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":36,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אַרְגָּמָ֛ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 27 16","book":"